# CODEOWNERS — who must review what
#
# Rules are evaluated bottom-up: the LAST matching pattern wins, so put the most specific paths last.
# Approval counts and mandatory owner requirements are defined by GOVERNANCE.md §5.
# Ordinary documentation-only and test-only changes need 1 approval; code, sensitive and policy changes
# need 2. Required area-owner or maintainer approvals count WITHIN the total, not as extra reviews.
# Mixed changes take the stricter applicable requirements. The author never counts as an approver.
# 审批人数与必需 owner 要求以 GOVERNANCE.zh-CN.md 第 5 节为准：普通仅文档、仅测试改动需 1 人，
# 代码、敏感改动及政策变更需 2 人；必需的领域 owner 或 maintainer 审批计入总人数，不额外增加评审人。
# 混合改动取适用的更严格要求，作者不计入审批人数。
#
# PLACEHOLDERS: `@InferTurbo/<team>` names below must exist as teams in the InferTurbo organisation.
# An owner that does not resolve is silently ignored by the platform, which means the review is NOT
# enforced. Before relying on this file, replace every team name with a real one (or with individual
# handles), and keep it in sync with MAINTAINERS.md.
#
# Verify hosting-platform support for CODEOWNERS and change-dependent approval counts before
# configuring enforcement. A mapping in this file does not prove that a matching gate is active.
# 配置自动执行前需核实平台对 CODEOWNERS 与按改动类型设置审批人数的支持；此映射不代表门禁已生效。

